{"title":"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> are on line segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, and both points are on the same side of the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />. Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> in the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/b/37bac8710233ca570649f0526e28b1a1ebb69d1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2:3$\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> in the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/e/8aeed4747bc966b093ca8740cc9bd952cf39c891.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3:4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/b/7ab17967324fc2b12349c0610c6c256f4c829162.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" />=2, then the length of segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/0/120883b44e66990e7a01153e58c2f57394170285.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 12\\quad \\text{(B) } 28\\quad \\text{(C) } 70\\quad \\text{(D) } 75\\quad \\text{(E) } 105$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"318\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In order, the points from left to right are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/b/5fb29aca5f7796fc5c608f0082319553fd9c17f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A, P, Q, B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"78\" height=\"16\" />.  Let the lengths between successive points be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/7/e17193b2a3dd4769114d0a58789e0e8ed0b29fbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, 2, y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, respectively.  \n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/d/03d074b37c0f5688d3fb25b8f5c36c66b140b3b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AP}{PB} = \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"68\" height=\"38\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/d/b6df58e1b05469678ff0254a1c6aa5c8c3275678.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{2 + y} = \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/b/7abc70da5d5831385bca6c36a20eadd8f2545f37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AQ}{QB} = \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"69\" height=\"41\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/0/df0cc126a069e115e9fd569f2c55c51169279168.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x + 2}{y} = \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"81\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p><p>The first equation gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/3/9534e545cdc3015ddae7b7bb2abca6c7523727c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{2}{3}(2 + y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"101\" height=\"37\" />.  Plugging that in to the second equation gives:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/0/a20967301ede7fa299290214f5d29b480037b51a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{2}{3}(2 + y) + 2}{y} = \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"140\" height=\"46\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/f/78fa5af3ca365a4531daa4003606ae37495956b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}(2 + y) + 2 = \\frac{3}{4}y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"145\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/5/3a5724bac9269368129ea0192dce6344d3a518cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{3} + \\frac{2}{3}y + 2 = \\frac{3}{4}y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"135\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/6/8f6ccfc240bc2da4af725a642634f56fc1b61262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10}{3} = \\frac{1}{12}y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"77\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/d/85d42462dac538e794345e1c7b20a8ce78bcec2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/3/9534e545cdc3015ddae7b7bb2abca6c7523727c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{2}{3}(2 + y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"101\" height=\"37\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/3/b73c64f6b2d79cee4ae6ca58e30a71557dcc9611.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 28$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />.  The length of the entire segment is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/4/e04fbd22015a0c2e0877c96452016b6f6b945ba2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 2 + y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, or option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef7ef72cd47d554d4b473d7e68935e75a19c0e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"25\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME\" title=\"1970 AHSME\">1970 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1970 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1970\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" tit